frastructure, as well as operates as a long-term digital transformation partner to government agencies. In addition, it offers technology solutions across sectors such as mining and allied services, government & public services, agriculture and allied services, industry and trade facilitation, education, healthcare, and tourism. Additionally, the company offers consulting and advisory services and provides self-service technologies that enable government organizations and corporate clients to migrate, automate, and manage customer-facing business processes through self-service channels. Further, it offers projects focused on the development of public digital infrastructure and implementation of e-governance platforms across various economic and social sectors, as well as AI and allied services; data and analytics; engineering, application and transformation; and IT facilities, cybersecurity, and partner services. CSM Technologies Limited was founded in 1998 and is based in Bhubaneswar, India.","employees":null,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":1790035200,"asOf":1795529266},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795529266,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"CSM Technologies\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"CSM Synapse 5.0 Quiz Expands To Three States, Six Cities","s":"Deccan Chronicle","d":1795523232,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":["plan"]},{"t":"CSM Synapse 5.0 goes multistate, reaches students across three states","s":"prameyanews.com","d":1795520303,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxPaDExR0tBdFl5MkY0eWRSR3ZPazloeGF5RjFweUpjU3NwakVkOWhCRjE2VF92M2lGbDk0MGN1czFqeDhESzlCYTJpVjdDSFFSRDlCLXdXRWFMLVlxc191R3dMa0p4MEFHU3N6dGx0eXRvZy1JTGpQTWNGRnRlQWgtbEVnMHNpaDZmV3J4SXgtTVIyaG5uQ2NEd09mYw?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"CSM Synapse 5.0 goes to quiz students in cities of across Odisha, Chhattisgarh & Jharkhand","s":"India Whispers","d":1795519859,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiww